                                            "A rectangular hole or slot."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "879fb4fc-97c6-49d4-b639-171846faa9f0",
                                                "sense_id": "74809837-9a88-364b-bd17-81a2a77299e4",
                                                "text": "His strength was running out fast: one more good letterbox was all that he could conceive himself able to make. He made it, hacking away with slow, painful strokes, his axe-handle slippery with his sweat."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
